                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-06-12T17:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 12, 1928—5
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>186. Your telegram 457, June 12, 7 p.m. Department adopts your view.</p>
